   "text": "In a November 5, 2026 official statement, Woodward said the DOJ Super Intelligence Task Force would promote innovation and prevent misuse of Super Intelligence. In a June 16, 2026 official statement, he said DOJ was committed to maintaining constitutional order while protecting national security and promoting American energy and innovation. A September 3, 2026 reported statement attributed to him said AI dominance is critical to national security, prosperity, and economic mobility for all Americans. In September 2026 X posts, he referenced cooperation on AI implications and an argument that training large language models on written works does not violate copyright law under fair use.",
